                                                                             LIN

A simple bare-bones Linux distribution.

This is just a [pack](https://codeberg.org/francescosaccone/pack) repository.


REQUIREMENTS


The build machine must be a POSIX system with the following utilities:

- GCC cross toolchain
- Gzip decompressor
- Lex
- Libelf
- Make
- Pack
- Yacc


INSTALLATION


The config.mk file can be customized beforehand.
